## The problem

I wanted one place to write, keep photographs and show work, without paying for a CMS or giving up fast pages.

## The approach

- Static HTML for every public page
- A private editor at a hidden route, saving straight to git
- An automated image pipeline so uploads never need manual resizing

## What is next

An animated gallery for the archive, and a playground for small interactive experiments.
